# Coding

- Strict TypeScript; no `any`
- State **why** (1–3 sentences) before non-obvious approaches
- App Router; `"use client"` at smallest leaf
- `cn()` for classes; Tailwind + design tokens
- **No inline `style={{}}`** unless a library requires runtime values (document why)
- Semantic HTML; one `h1` per page
- `next/image`, `next/link`; dynamic import heavy client islands
- Do not import GSAP/Three into server trees
